<title>GERMANY: Heidelberger says 9-mth grp sales rise.</title>
<headline>Heidelberger says 9-mth grp sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>HEIDELBERG, Germany 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to September 30</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group sales				  4,813   vs 4,.589</p>
<p>Of which:</p>
<p>     -- Central Europe-West		  1,828   vs 1,912</p>
<p>     -- Central Europe-East		  385     vs 345</p>
<p>     -- Western Europe			 1,075   vs 1,074</p>
<p>     -- North America			  1,398   vs 1,258</p>
<p>     -- Turkey				   127     vs N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German cement supplier is Heidelberger Zement AG. The company said it saw double-digit growth in third-quarter sales and was optimistic for further growth in the fourth quarter.</p>
<p>But Heidelberger said it was still suffering from the recessonary conditions in the European construction industry, particularly in Germany.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
